ecological health in the Avon Bristol and Somerset North Streams
catchment, for 2019 and 2022. The y-axis shows percentage from 0% to
100%; the x-axis shows year. Both data points sit at approximately 14-15%,
showing virtually no change and reflecting the national picture of
persistently poor surface water quality.' width=672}
