properties in the West of England with an EPC energy rating of A or A+,
from 2017 to 2026. The y-axis shows percentage from 0% to 100%; the
x-axis shows date. The line rises very gradually from under 2% to
approximately 6% by 2026, showing slow but steady improvement in the
proportion of best-performing non-domestic buildings.' width=672}
